msgid "Shortcodes"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-shortcodes.php:16
msgid "Tinylytics comes with a variety of shortcodes which can be embedded directly in a post, page, or theme block to reduce the need for extensive HTML customizations."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-shortcodes.php:19
msgid "Displays an interactive button to track \"kudos\" given by readers. Best used directly in posts and pages."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-shortcodes.php:20
msgid "Displays a count of page loads of the page viewed. Best used directly in posts and pages."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-shortcodes.php:21
msgid "Displays both overall site hits and uptime (Note: a Tinylytics subscription is required to display uptime). Best used in the footer of your site."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-shortcodes.php:22
msgid "Displays a random link to a Tinylytics webring site. Enabling the \"Display webring avatars?\" option will include the avatar if the site has one. Best used in the footer of your site."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-shortcodes.php:23
msgid "Displays flags from all the countries of site visitors. Best used in the footer of your site."
msgstr ""

